  "interpretation": "Each case is independent. Shallow replace named top-level base fields; arrays/objects replace entirely. Row keys resolve through retainedRows. All facts, UUIDs and authority booleans are invented test setup, never caller authority. For accepted cases assume the proposed intake already validated/persisted precisely that isolated bundle; version UUIDs are placeholders, not derived from hashes. Expected outcomes apply only after root adopts and Context implements this proposal. Current live-source outcome remains unsupported for every case. Refused comparison/ref are null; do not expose private reasons to unauthorized callers. This is a fixture description, not an executable patch API. Only the rows selected by a case exist in that isolated fixture; dictionary alternatives sharing a primary key are never inserted together.",
